---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Mentorship" description="The NSBE Queen's peer mentorship program, connecting Black engineering students with upper-year mentors and graduates.">
<!-- ============ PAGE HERO ============ -->
<header class="page-hero">
  <div class="page-hero-bg" style="background-image:url('/images/uploads/VAL2415-2-1024x683.jpg'); background-position: center 28%;"></div>
  <div class="page-hero-scrim"></div>
  <div class="container page-hero-content">
    <h1>NSBE Queen's Mentorship Program</h1>
    <p>Connecting students to opportunities, guidance, and community.</p>
  </div>
</header>

<!-- ============ FEATURES ============ -->
<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="feature-grid reveal-stagger">
      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="num">01</div>
        <h3>Academic Guidance</h3>
        <p>Support with coursework, study strategies, and navigating university life.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="num">02</div>
        <h3>Career Development</h3>
        <p>Advice on internships, job search strategies, and professional networking.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="num">03</div>
        <h3>Peer Connection</h3>
        <p>Build friendships and a sense of belonging within the NSBE community.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="num">04</div>
        <h3>Personal Growth</h3>
        <p>Gain confidence, motivation, and a support system to help you succeed.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ GET INVOLVED ============ -->
<section class="section section-alt">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head center">
      <p class="kicker" style="justify-content:center;">How It Works</p>
      <h2>Get Involved</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="mentor-grid reveal-stagger">
      <div class="mentor-card mentor">
        <h3>Become a Mentor</h3>
        <p>Take on a leadership role and guide the next generation of Black engineers and computer scientists. Share your experiences, offer advice on academics and careers, and help students navigate challenges with confidence. In the process, you'll grow your own leadership, communication, and networking skills.</p>
        <a href="https://forms.office.com/pages/responsepage.aspx?id=eCPPiRaKW0S_qx14hTcxIfIfrevCp2pDmAz_Tu6kRKJUM1JJR08wWDFKMFpZNzdHOUQyVEM3Wk83RS4u&route=shorturl" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn">Learn More <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14M13 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg></a>
      </div>
      <div class="mentor-card mentee">
        <h3>Become a Mentee</h3>
        <p>Join a supportive community where you can learn from upper-year students and professionals who have already walked the path you're on. Gain advice on studying, career opportunities, and personal growth while building meaningful connections that will carry you through university and beyond.</p>
        <a href="https://forms.office.com/pages/responsepage.aspx?id=eCPPiRaKW0S_qx14hTcxIUxNBzg-5Z9Ev1b3atp6EKFUQlNJV0Q2RVdCQ0FVMzRXSVVDMTdZVTdWWi4u&route=shorturl" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn">Learn More <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14M13 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ GALLERY SPLIT ============ -->
<section class="section">
  <div class="container split">
    <div class="split-body reveal">
      <p class="kicker">Real Connections</p>
      <h2>Building Lasting Relationships</h2>
      <p>Our mentorship program pairs first and second-year students with upper-year mentors who've walked the same halls, faced the same courses, and found their footing at Queen's. From coffee chats to résumé reviews, mentorship at NSBE is hands-on and personal.</p>
      <p>Whether you're looking for guidance or ready to give back, there's a place for you in the program.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="split-media reveal">
      <img src="/images/uploads/IMG_9728-1-1024x741.jpg" alt="NSBE Queen's mentorship session" loading="lazy">
      <div class="frame-accent"></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ FIRST YEAR ============ -->
<section class="section section-rule" id="first-year">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="firstyear reveal">
      <div>
        <p class="kicker">Starting at Queen's</p>
        <h2>Your first year, mapped out</h2>
        <p>First year is the steepest part of the climb. Our First Year Transition Manual walks you through course loads, study habits, campus resources, residence life, and where NSBE fits into all of it, written by students who have already been through it.</p>
        <p>Pair it with a mentor and you start the year with someone in your corner from week one.</p>
        <a href="https://www.canva.com/design/DAGyWr0voSg/hnKorV_xhrJ3nouw59Z3vw/view" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn-purple">Open the First Year Transition Manual <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14M13 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg></a>
      </div>
      <ul class="firstyear-list">
        <li><span class="n">1</span><span>Read the transition manual before move-in week.</span></li>
        <li><span class="n">2</span><span>Sign up as a mentee and get matched with an upper-year student in your program.</span></li>
        <li><span class="n">3</span><span>Come to a first-year social and meet the rest of your cohort.</span></li>
        <li><span class="n">4</span><span>Join study pods and exam prep sessions once midterms hit.</span></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ COMMUNITY GALLERY ============ -->
<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head center">
      <p class="kicker" style="justify-content:center;">Our Community</p>
      <h2>The people behind the program</h2>
      <p>Mentors, mentees, and the wider NSBE Queen's community throughout the year.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="gallery-grid reveal-stagger">
      <a href="/images/uploads/IMG_9728-1-1024x741.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="tall"><img src="/images/uploads/IMG_9728-1-1024x741.jpg" alt="NSBE Queen's mentorship session" loading="lazy"></a>
      <a href="/images/uploads/IMG_9716-1024x683.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img src="/images/uploads/IMG_9716-1024x683.jpg" alt="NSBE Queen's members at a chapter event" loading="lazy"></a>
      <a href="/images/uploads/hunt-conference-06.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img src="/images/uploads/hunt-conference-06.jpg" alt="Members at the HUNT Conference at McMaster University" loading="lazy"></a>
      <a href="/images/uploads/Black-Engineer-Mixer-09-1-768x512.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img src="/images/uploads/Black-Engineer-Mixer-09-1-768x512.jpg" alt="Black Engineer Mixer" loading="lazy"></a>
      <a href="/images/uploads/IMG_9731-scaled.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img src="/images/uploads/IMG_9731-scaled.jpg" alt="NSBE Queen's social" loading="lazy"></a>
      <a href="/images/uploads/internship-panel-02.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img src="/images/uploads/internship-panel-02.jpg" alt="Panellists and organisers after the NSBE Internship Panel" loading="lazy"></a>
      <a href="/images/uploads/VAL2415-1-scaled.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img src="/images/uploads/VAL2415-1-scaled.jpg" alt="NSBE Queen's community event" loading="lazy"></a>
      <a href="/images/uploads/IMG_5515-1-768x1024.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="tall"><img src="/images/uploads/IMG_5515-1-768x1024.jpg" alt="Members walking across Queen's campus together" loading="lazy"></a>
      <a href="/images/uploads/hunt-conference-09.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img src="/images/uploads/hunt-conference-09.jpg" alt="NSBE Queen's delegation at the HUNT Conference" loading="lazy"></a>
      <a href="/images/uploads/IMG_7027-768x576.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img src="/images/uploads/IMG_7027-768x576.jpg" alt="NSBE Queen's members" loading="lazy"></a>
      <a href="/images/uploads/internship-panel-07.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img src="/images/uploads/internship-panel-07.jpg" alt="Members talking with a QUIP representative over food" loading="lazy"></a>
      <a href="/images/uploads/IMG_9703-2048x1365.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img src="/images/uploads/IMG_9703-2048x1365.jpg" alt="NSBE Queen's group photo" loading="lazy"></a>
      <a href="/images/uploads/hunt-conference-07.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img src="/images/uploads/hunt-conference-07.jpg" alt="NSBE Queen's members networking at the HUNT Conference" loading="lazy"></a>
      <a href="/images/uploads/internship-panel-04.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img src="/images/uploads/internship-panel-04.jpg" alt="A past intern answering questions during the panel discussion" loading="lazy"></a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ CONTACT STRIP ============ -->
<section class="section-tight section-alt">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="resource-box reveal">
      <p>Questions about the program? Reach the mentorship team at <a class="mail" href="mailto:nsbe.mentorship@engsoc.queensu.ca">nsbe.mentorship@engsoc.queensu.ca</a></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ FOOTER ============ -->
</BaseLayout>
